<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soquimich.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soquimich.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Mauricio Reveco said he raised his rating on Sociedad Quimica y Minera de Chile, or Soquimich, to buy from hold on a weakening in the price.</p>
<p>-- &quot;While we do agree that Soquimich's traditional premium to the local market should be eroded due to the increase in competition in its principal products, we still think Soquimich should trade at a premium to the market,&quot; Reveco said in a research note.</p>
</text>
